SUMMARY:Niagara Falls Concert Road Trip: Rick Springfield.Just $60 total
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n🎸
 🚗 Concert Road Trip: Rick Springfield at OLG Stage 🎶\n\nWho’s up f
 or a summer concert adventure? Join us Sunday\, July 12 for an unforgettab
 le road trip to see legendary rocker Rick Springfield at the amazing OLG S
 tage!\nWe’ll hit the road in true style aboard a mighty Kia Soul equippe
 d with SiriusXM satellite radio for the perfect highway soundtrack. Depend
 ing on traffic\, we may even squeeze in a little sightseeing before the sh
 ow.\n\n[Concert info here](https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/events-and-pr
 omotions/schedule-of-events/rick-springfield.html)\n\n📍 Departing: 4 PM
  sharp outside Christie Station\n🎤 Concert Starts: 7:00 PM\n🚘 Transp
 ortation: Round-trip from Toronto included\n🎟️ Ticket Included\n💵 
 Total Cost: Just $60\n\nTo lock in your spot\, send a $60 e-transfer to:\n
 nicolasbello@yahoo.com\n\nWe should be back in Toronto around 11:30PM or s
 o\n\n⚠️ Very limited spots available — once the Kia Soul is full\, t
 hat’s it!\nExpect great music\, good company\, spontaneous roadside fun\
 , and a memorable summer night out. 🎵🌅
